  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ねたまま　うまれ　ねたまま　しぬ。\nすべての　こうどうは　みている\nゆめに　よる　ねぞう　らしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "잔 채 태어나고 잔 채 죽는다.\n모든 행동은 꾸고 있는\n꿈에 의한 잠버릇인 것 같다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "睡著生，睡著死。\n似乎所有的行動都是根據\n所看見的夢而引發的睡相。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il rejoint et quitte ce monde en dormant. Son\nexistence se déroule comme un rêve paisible.\nIl dort du sommeil du juste toute sa vie durant.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es wird schlafend geboren und stirbt schlafend.\nSein ganzes Leben ist ein Traum, seine einzige\nkörperliche Aktivität das Umdrehen im Schlaf.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pasa la vida entera sumido en un profundo\nsueño. Toda su actividad parece reflejar los\nsueños que tiene en ese momento.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Trascorre la sua intera esistenza dormendo.\nPare che le sue azioni siano determinate\nda quello che sta sognando.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It is born asleep, and it dies asleep. All its\nmovements are apparently no more than the\nresults of it tossing and turning in its dreams.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "寝たまま　生まれ　寝たまま　死ぬ。\nすべての　行動は　みている\n夢に　よる　寝相　らしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "睡着生，睡着死。\n似乎所有的行动都是根据\n所看见的梦而引发的睡相。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pasa la vida entera sumido en un profundo\nsueño. Toda su actividad parece reflejar los\nsueños que tiene en ese momento.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "だいた　きは　うまれたとき　おやから\nあたえられたもの。　よく　なつけば\nトレーナーの　うでにも　しがみつく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "안고 있는 나무는 태어났을 때 부모로부터\n받은 것이다. 잘 길들이면\n트레이너의 팔에도 달라붙는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "抱住的樹是出生時父母所贈的。\n關係親密的話，也會緊緊抱著\n訓練家的胳膊。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La bûche qu’il tient est un cadeau de naissance\nde ses parents. S’il est bien apprivoisé,\nil s’accrochera au bras de son Dresseur.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Den Baumstumpf bekam es zu seiner Geburt\nvon seinen Eltern. Fasst es Zutrauen, klammert\nes sich aber auch am Arm seines Trainers fest.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El tronco que agarra es un regalo que le dieron\nsus padres al nacer. También se aferra al brazo\nde todo aquel Entrenador con el que congenie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il tronco che ha con sé è un dono dei genitori\nricevuto alla nascita. Quando è molto affezionato\nal proprio Allenatore, si aggrappa al suo braccio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The log it holds was given to it by its parents at\nbirth. It has also been known to cling to the arm\nof a friendly Trainer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "抱いた　木は　生まれたとき　親から\n与えられたもの。　よく　なつけば\nトレーナーの　腕にも　しがみつく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "抱住的树干是出生时父母所给予的。\n关系亲密的话，也会紧紧抱着\n训练家的胳膊。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El tronco que agarra es un regalo que le dieron\nsus padres al nacer. También se aferra al brazo\nde todo aquel Entrenador con el que congenie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "うまれてから　ずっと　ねむったまま。\nふかい　ねむりに　おちているときは\nいっさい　うごかなくなる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "태어날 때부터 계속 자고 있다.\n깊은 수면에 빠져 있을 때는\n일체 움직이지 않는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "從出生那刻起就一直在睡覺。\n當進入深度睡眠的時候，\n會變得完全靜止不動。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il dort continuellement depuis sa naissance.\nLorsqu’il est en phase de sommeil profond,\nil ne bouge plus d’un poil.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vom Augenblick seiner Geburt an verbringt es\nsein ganzes Leben schlafend. Wenn es extrem\ntief schläft, wird es völlig regungslos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Duerme continuamente desde que nace. Cuando\nel sueño en el que está sumido es especialmente\nprofundo, se queda inmóvil.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dorme ininterrottamente fin dalla nascita.\nQuando il suo sonno è particolarmente profondo\nrimane completamente immobile.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It stays asleep from the moment it’s born.\nWhen it falls into a deep sleep, it stops\nmoving altogether.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "生まれてから　ずっと　眠ったまま。\n深い　眠りに　落ちているときは\n一切　動かなくなる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "出生后就一直都睡着。\n进入深度睡眠的时候，\n会变的一动也不动。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Duerme continuamente desde que nace. Cuando\nel sueño en el que está sumido es especialmente\nprofundo, se queda inmóvil.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "しぬまで　ずっと　ねむったままなのは\nエサの　はっぱに　ますいの　ような\nせいぶんが　ふくまれているからだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "죽을 때까지 계속 잠들어 있는 이유는\n먹이인 잎사귀에 마취 성분이\n포함되어 있기 때문이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "終其一生都處於睡著的狀態。\n這是因為牠所吃的葉子裡\n含有類似麻醉藥的成分。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon passe sa vie entière à dormir\nà cause des composants anesthésiants qui\nse trouvent dans les feuilles qu’il mange.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es verbringt sein Leben schlafend, bis es stirbt.\nDas liegt an den narkotisierenden Wirkstoffen,\ndie in den Blättern enthalten sind, die es frisst.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El motivo de su letargo vitalicio es la sustancia\nsomnífera que contienen las hojas de las que\nse alimenta.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Poiché le foglie di cui si nutre contengono una\nsostanza soporifera, Komala trascorre la sua\nintera vita dormendo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It remains asleep from birth to death as a result\nof the sedative properties of the leaves that\nform its diet.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "死ぬまで　ずっと　眠ったままなのは\nエサの　葉っぱに　麻酔の　ような\n成分が　含まれているからだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
